<hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">I&#x017F;utis, Gla&#x017F;tum</hi>,</hi> franz. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pa&#x017F;tel</hi>,</hi> oder<lb/>
